# logs
logs/

# ── Experiment output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The repository ships CODE and TUNED CONFIGS; it does not ship results. Runs
# are reproduced on whatever machine the sweep is launched on, and keeping them
# here would put ~150 MB of prior output in front of every clone. Ignoring them
# does not delete anything already on disk.
#
# Historical note: ablation/runs_v2/ held the 221-cell sweep from the symmetric
# head period (2026-08-19 ~ 08-21). ih_symmetric=True with the linear residual
# removed collapses the head to bias-only, so toxcast/freesolv/esol in that tree
# are invalid. Kept on disk as evidence, never committed.
ablation/runs/
ablation/runs_*/

# Per-trial artifacts of an Optuna study (training logs, curves, per-trial
# metrics) — hundreds of directories, ~24 MB, and regenerated by re-running the
# study. best_config.json / best_trial.json / study_config.json / trials.csv
# stay tracked: those are what seed_expansion.py reads to reproduce a run.
dual_kd_gnn/optuna/*/trials/

# Single-run artifacts and generated tables/figures.
dual_kd_gnn/runs/
# results/artifacts/

# Process id written by the pipeline launcher.
*.pid